      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْكُوتٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>Changed in colour</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَمِدٌ</span>) <i>by reason
